Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Telepathy Division Team 3,\Nreport to Longyou Guild and stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,On our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The Telepathy Division has confirmed\Nthe target has left our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Zone 11 confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Zone 43 confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Zone 23 in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tianxing Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.33,0:01:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. I will handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wuxian's here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Wuxian has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The temporary portal is being set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They started about an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them sense our spirit energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,so we have to take it slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the backup plans for this mission
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,requires Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Under the contingency plan’s call-up rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,we need him in position first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hall Manager filled me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have him on standby in Longyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.62,0:01:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll decide after I get the full picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.50,0:02:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in charge of this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Baiyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other side is Tianxing Pavilion,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,a spirit faction like the Guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,far away on the Hezhou Continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Two hundred years ago,\Nthey founded Pingpaer, a theocratic nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and became the gods its people worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They've never had any conflict with the Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been on neutral terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pavilion Master, Ye Wenlan,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.17,0:02:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ascended to immortality\Nsix hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,His strength is unfathomable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a renowned Binding-type master
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and an expert on how spirit energy works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Binding forges essence into artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Many of the finest artifacts were made by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The kidnapped spirit is named Dongdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His ability is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:02:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Time Lag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.21,0:03:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Time Lag?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on what we know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,we can confirm he's behind this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but he'll never admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If we show any sign of suspicion,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,even just by asking,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,he could destroy all the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.37,0:03:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a 93% chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.37,0:03:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Negotiation isn't an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Binding-type experts estimate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,even the Master of Tianxing Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.75,0:03:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,would need at least two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have ten hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's plenty of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but we only get one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tianxing Pavilion has four\Nartifacts that protect the sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tianxing Lamp
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,covers a ten-kilometer radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No outsider's spirit escapes its notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It locks down the space and blocks all teleportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Earthshaking Bell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,sends waves through the ground to sense what's below.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Together with the Lamp,\Nit leaves no blind spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Fuxi Array has four layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They surround the whole area, all linked together,\Nand are nearly impossible to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Roaming Dragon Spear hunts down its target,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:03:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,through sky and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:03:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,until it nails them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need to worry about that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,because the moment we're sensed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.71,0:04:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the mission fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The four artifacts complement each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,making it a fortress no one can sneak into.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And infiltrating
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.12,0:04:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,is exactly what we need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What about a rapid assault?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're already on lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd only consider an attack if it takes under five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, our fastest assault team took 27 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How long would it take you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't know until I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The faster I go,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the harder it is to control the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed is the priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Field 5, in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Field 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.37,0:04:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Field 5, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat: Field 5, target in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Field 5, defense in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteen kilometers away,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,fifty meters underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you sense the spirit energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:04:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Rapid assault test 17: Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Rapid assault test 17: Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop him with everything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear the area. Everyone, stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.62,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Lord Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't get any faster, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,With unknown enemies in the mix,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll only be slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say fifteen seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,anything over five seconds is off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And it won't get any faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Infiltration is our only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that even harder?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Wuxian made his move,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,would you be able to destroy the evidence in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he devoured his way in, there'd be time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything over five seconds, we can't take that gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Infiltration is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We have six infiltration plans right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan 5 is you and Suhe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tianxing Lamp covers a 7.5-kilometer radius,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but it can't reach underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Underground, there's the Earthshaking Bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It strikes once every twenty seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and the wave travels at ten meters per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If it touches you, the alarm goes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the pattern consistent?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We've only been watching it for four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It could still change.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.37,0:07:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,After you devour,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,teleport into the next spot you devour,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep hopping past the waves like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.04,0:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Suhe can teleport up to 200 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, 100 meters is ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once every ten seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,160 jumps without a single mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:07:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll reach the destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't they sense the hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop this before you leave the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,One second after it hits the ground, it fills the entire hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The rock around here is veined white marble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the red bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.21,0:08:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When you reach this section,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,it's adamantine rock. Use the blue bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just those two kinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll tell you when to switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mix them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you sense it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The distance is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,About a meter total.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've hardly ever opened one somewhere I couldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.83,0:08:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You rely too much on your sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sense of space isn't strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not something you can fix overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You take too long to open them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And where they land isn't consistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One mistake, and there's no fixing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I open the portal first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and Lord Wuxian devours after?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That could work...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But can you promise your portal won't touch a wave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So Lord Wuxian, you're saying
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.75,0:09:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you can definitely devour wherever I open the portal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.21,0:09:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I devour first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you at least have a rough target.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you open first, it'll be even less accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.79,0:09:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To allow for that margin of error,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll need to wait an extra two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:09:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That keeps each jump about ten seconds apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the time to open and close, that works,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but the bell's frequency can't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.17,0:10:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With defensive artifacts,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,unless you enter their sensing range,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll never know how they'll change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will the mission take?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixteen kilometers. Twenty-six minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything changes at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If it fails halfway,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,can we switch to an assault?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,An underground assault
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,would be even slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's only a backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything over five seconds is a no-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are the other infiltration plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.87,0:10:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan 1 is fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but he can't get past the guards and physical barriers inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan 2 can reach the target without being sensed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but he isn't a fighter
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and has no way to bring the target out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's caught, he can't fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he brings the Qiongyuan Shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he protect the target for ten seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The shield itself can't be masked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan 3 is to destroy the Tianxing Lamp from a distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:10:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,so we could teleport in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:11:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just as slow and hard\Nas going straight for the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan 4 can't even get near the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.17,0:11:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So we've dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You said there were six.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan 6 is Laojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Laojun could probably get past the Tianxing Lamp,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but since it would break his oath, he refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So Xiaohei is the backup for Plan 5?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my reservations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The backup plan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,is a ten-year-old spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,not an Executor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He opens portals fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but his range is under fifty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd take over 300 jumps,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,with only three seconds between each one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the wave pattern doesn't change,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,just making it there would be extremely hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,who do you think is the better choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he in Longyou?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.87,0:11:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's let the results speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Set up a private testing area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Training Zone 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.88,0:12:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I come and watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of the candidates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer for the portal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow and steady. Don't rush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.87,0:12:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we need to run a test
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,to see if you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to open your portal from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go as far as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,58 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Has it started?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,56.8 to 58.2.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You've improved again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how to control the distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do 50 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:13:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sense my Devour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.83,0:14:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's seriously impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Test complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.33,0:15:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No objections here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.83,0:15:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.21,0:15:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.44,0:15:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Baiyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xiaohei, thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will this really be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on your own job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Communication Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't used one of these in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.83,0:15:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A Breath-Holding Pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep it in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.67,0:15:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no air inside the rock I devour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With you here, Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,what's there to be nervous about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you sense my Devour,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,immediately open your portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine if you're a little off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll correct it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,First, let's get the rhythm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep this rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving steadily like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not in the sensing zone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:04.12,Default,,200,0,0,,{\an1}After three more jumps,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:05.22,Default,,200,0,0,,{\an1}we'll enter the sensing zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:07.42,Default,,0,450,0,,{\an3}4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.37,0:17:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.71,0:17:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The sensing zone is just ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the sensing zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.71,0:18:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Over 170 to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is way too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.31,0:18:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Over thirty minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch to the blue bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.25,0:19:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.29,0:19:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:19:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission paused.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.75,0:20:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,An intruder?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.96,0:20:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a faint crack in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably a natural crack, or an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ancestor needs two more hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep sensing at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.25,0:20:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing on your end yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.75,0:20:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Earthshaking Bell has definitely stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And the target's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wuxian, while the waves are down,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you can push ahead faster for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pick up the pace a little this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.87,0:20:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.67,0:20:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.21,0:21:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish it could stay like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Wuxian,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the waves are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The wave's still a ways off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep this pace for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have sensed something off
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and switched its wavelength on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But it didn't trigger the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.87,0:21:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The interval's gotten shorter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's once every ten seconds now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Two more sources just appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.42,0:21:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's five now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.67,0:21:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,all at different heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.21,0:21:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch to perspective view.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.83,0:21:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way to read this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Five hundred meters until the wave hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.50,0:21:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you sense where the target is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:21:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,From here on, treat the target as Position 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.83,0:22:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow my calls for distance and direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,on the way back, I'm Position 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,200 meters left. Three more jumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.12,0:22:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Left 3, forty-three meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.67,0:22:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.12,0:22:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Position 1, fifty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.96,0:22:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Left 3, forty-five meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.25,0:22:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.87,0:22:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Right 3, thirty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.75,0:22:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Right 3, forty-seven meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Left 3, forty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.42,0:22:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Position 1, double jump, thirty meters each.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.62,0:22:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Two seconds apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Left 2, forty-six meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Back to the red pouch
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.19,0:22:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.20,0:22:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:22:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.21,0:22:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't sense anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stay on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.71,0:23:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it just us, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything moves,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.25,0:23:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,strike immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wait for my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.58,0:23:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.54,0:23:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're close to the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.33,0:23:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Six more to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.84,0:23:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Left 2, fifty-three meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.91,0:23:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Five more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.83,0:23:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right 2, forty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Position 1, twenty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.05,0:23:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.50,0:23:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Three more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.46,0:23:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Left 2, thirty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.58,0:23:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.00,0:23:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.17,0:23:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right 2, forty-five meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.42,0:23:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.25,0:23:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.08,0:23:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.17,0:24:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.96,0:24:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.08,0:24:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.17,0:24:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.90,0:24:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.79,0:24:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these Earth-types insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.16,0:24:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Lord Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.12,0:24:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Right 2, forty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.71,0:24:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Position 1, fifty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.35,0:24:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.96,0:24:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.42,0:24:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.12,0:24:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul intact, spirit space seems stable. He's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.33,0:24:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally got to do a mission with you, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.58,0:24:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.83,0:24:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you, this mission would've been very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.79,0:24:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.17,0:24:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.71,0:24:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.29,0:24:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job, Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.54,0:24:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are still waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.42,0:24:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go find them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.54,0:25:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.71,0:25:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Wuxian didn't make him an Executor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.79,0:25:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still young.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.37,0:25:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll make a great Executor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.67,0:25:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody can do everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.79,0:25:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even Wuxian
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.87,0:25:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,could have done this mission alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.40,0:25:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.29,0:25:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.12,0:25:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pulling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.58,0:25:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we destroy the portal?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.21,0:25:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.58,0:25:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The higher-ups want to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.45,0:25:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.50,0:26:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pavilion Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.83,0:26:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild just cut ties with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.67,0:26:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they say why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.92,0:26:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.75,0:26:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.83,0:26:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Pavilion Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.29,0:26:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it worth it?
